      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not quite sure what you\u0027re asking for.  As implemented, there are two defconfig files setup, one for the IT81202 variant and one for the IT81302 variant.\nI think we\u0027re constrained by Zephyr\u0027s build system that the defconfig filename must match the Zephyr board name (it81202bx_defconfig and it81302bx_defconfig).",
